{"format":"atelier-package","version":1,"name":"YouTube video script","generator":"Atelier template library","boards":[{"id":"youtubevideoscript-b1","name":"YouTube video script","parent":null,"description":"Script a video section by section with talking points, visual cues and B-roll, timed on a timecode ruler so the edit lands on length.","color":"theme","cards":[{"id":"youtubevideoscript-cd","type":"column","x":40,"y":873,"w":520,"h":312,"title":"B-roll list","body":"","color":"stone","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-ck","type":"column","x":600,"y":873,"w":520,"h":226,"title":"On-screen text","body":"","color":"stone","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-cm","type":"column","x":1160,"y":873,"w":520,"h":186,"title":"Delivery notes","body":"","color":"stone","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-co","type":"column","x":1720,"y":873,"w":520,"h":186,"title":"Links for the description","body":"","color":"stone","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-c2","type":"heading","x":40,"y":40,"w":1180,"h":67,"title":"Script — “Your zip isn’t broken (it’s the slider)”","body":"Target 13 minutes. Each section is a card with what is said and what is seen; the ruler shows how long each one runs.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-c3","type":"sticky","x":1260,"y":40,"w":380,"h":200,"title":"How to use this template","body":"Write talking points, not paragraphs — it keeps delivery natural. Put visual cues in italics. If a section grows on the ruler, cut something from the next one.","color":"sky","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-c4","type":"timeline","x":40,"y":280,"w":2160,"h":318,"title":"Running order — 25 fps","body":"","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"timeline":{"mode":"timecode","fps":[25,1],"drop":false,"start":0,"end":20250,"links":false,"items":[{"id":"youtubevideoscript-tq","card":"youtubevideoscript-c5","at":0,"len":375,"lane":0},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-tr","card":"youtubevideoscript-c6","at":375,"len":500,"lane":0},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-ts","card":"youtubevideoscript-c7","at":875,"len":1125,"lane":1},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-tt","card":"youtubevideoscript-c8","at":2000,"len":1750,"lane":0},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-tu","card":"youtubevideoscript-c9","at":3750,"len":3750,"lane":0},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-tv","card":"youtubevideoscript-ca","at":7500,"len":8250,"lane":0},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-tw","card":"youtubevideoscript-cb","at":15750,"len":2250,"lane":1},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-tx","card":"youtubevideoscript-cc","at":18000,"len":1500,"lane":0}]}},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-c5","type":"note","x":40,"y":646,"w":256,"h":179,"title":"Cold open","body":"A zip splits open on a £180 coat. “This is the moment most people buy a new coat. Give me ten minutes.”\n\n*Visual: Macro, slow motion*","color":"sand","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-c6","type":"note","x":312,"y":646,"w":256,"h":159,"title":"Title + intro","body":"Logo sting. “I’m Ruth, this is Fix & Mend.” One line on today’s fix.\n\n*Visual: Bench wide*","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-c7","type":"note","x":584,"y":646,"w":256,"h":139,"title":"Why zips fail","body":"Animated slider: the jaws spread, teeth stop meeting.\n\n*Visual: Animation*","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-c8","type":"note","x":856,"y":646,"w":256,"h":139,"title":"Diagnose","body":"Teeth missing? Then it’s a new zip. Teeth fine? It’s the slider.\n\n*Visual: Macro on teeth*","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-c9","type":"note","x":1128,"y":646,"w":256,"h":139,"title":"Fix A — squeeze","body":"Pliers, gentle squeeze on both sides of the slider. Test. Repeat.\n\n*Visual: Overhead + macro*","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-ca","type":"note","x":1400,"y":646,"w":256,"h":139,"title":"Fix B — replace slider","body":"Remove top stop, swap slider, crimp new stop.\n\n*Visual: Overhead + macro*","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-cb","type":"note","x":1672,"y":646,"w":256,"h":139,"title":"Fix C — give up gracefully","body":"When teeth are gone: take it to a tailor; what it costs.\n\n*Visual: Bench wide*","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-cc","type":"note","x":1944,"y":646,"w":256,"h":139,"title":"Outro + CTA","body":"“Send us a photo of your fix.” End screen to the next video.\n\n*Visual: Bench wide*","color":"sand","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-ce","type":"task","x":56,"y":928,"w":488,"h":233,"title":"Capture","body":"","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[{"id":"youtubevideoscript-if","text":"Coat zip splitting (slow motion, 3 takes)","done":false},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-ig","text":"Slider close-up, before/after","done":false},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-ih","text":"Parts laid out flat-lay","done":false},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-ii","text":"Hands crimping a top stop","done":false},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-ij","text":"Finished coat on a hanger","done":false}],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"youtubevideoscript-cd"},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-cl","type":"note","x":616,"y":928,"w":488,"h":147,"title":"Supers","body":"00:00:10 — “£180 coat”\n00:02:35 — “Fix A: 2 minutes”\n00:05:05 — “Fix B: 10 minutes, £2 part”\n00:10:35 — “Tailor: £15–30”","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"youtubevideoscript-ck"},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-cn","type":"note","x":1176,"y":928,"w":488,"h":107,"title":"Tone","body":"Calm and certain. Smile on the cold open line. Slow down on the steps; the viewer is following along with pliers in hand.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"youtubevideoscript-cm"},{"id":"youtubevideoscript-cp","type":"note","x":1736,"y":928,"w":488,"h":107,"title":"Chapters","body":"00:00 Intro · 00:35 Why zips fail · 01:20 Diagnose · 02:30 Squeeze · 05:00 Replace · 10:30 When to give up","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"youtubevideoscript-co"}],"edges":[],"view":{"x":60,"y":50,"zoom":0.8},"updated":0,"template":{"id":"lib-youtube-video-script","version":"1.0.0"}}]}